# A low-contrast platform: the effective index sits close to the cladding.
# Reference: SciPy root of the dispersion relation.
title 400 nm silicon nitride slab in oxide
stack core=0.4
materials core=sin
grating angle=10 etch=0.2
sweep 1.45 1.65 201
expect n_full 1.74339491 2e-07
expect n_etched 1.58407701 2e-07
expect n_grating 1.66373596 2e-07
expect group_index 1.91245568 0.0002
